WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.533 --> 00:00:17.600
Trust your heart with your Pokémon completely!

2
00:00:17.666 --> 00:00:19.966
And soon you will have true vision.

3
00:00:21.133 --> 00:00:24.966
There is a hot, hot light hidden deep within our minds.

4
00:00:25.033 --> 00:00:27.466
The stars will guide that light

5
00:00:27.533 --> 00:00:30.666
from our minds through the vastness of space.

6
00:00:30.733 --> 00:00:35.233
Yes! We are all truly one with the universe.

7
00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:39.300
The truth? Each and every one of us is totally connected to the universe!

8
00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:47.600
Oh, my! Lady Olympia!

9
00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:59.200
I see it. A light!

10
00:01:04.866 --> 00:01:07.333
In the near future,

11
00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:12.000
Kalos will face an unprecedented threat!

12
00:01:12.066 --> 00:01:15.000
And trapped within the vortex of this threat, I see them!

13
00:01:15.066 --> 00:01:18.733
The faces of those who will gather here in Anistar City!

14
00:01:22.100 --> 00:01:27.666
One with a deep-green eye. And those who walk alongside it.

15
00:01:28.666 --> 00:01:32.066
And the one who will show the way!

16
00:01:32.133 --> 00:01:34.933
Ohhhhh...

17
00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:36.800
♪ You're just a kid on a quest ♪

18
00:01:36.866 --> 00:01:38.566
♪ To be the best of the best ♪

19
00:01:38.633 --> 00:01:42.000
♪ Someday you're destined for power and glory ♪

20
00:01:42.066 --> 00:01:43.466
♪ You know you're up to the test ♪

21
00:01:43.533 --> 00:01:47.300
♪ There's only one way to tell this story ♪

22
00:01:47.366 --> 00:01:50.566
♪ Be a hero! Be a hero! ♪

23
00:01:50.633 --> 00:01:54.000
♪ All the power is at your command ♪

24
00:01:54.066 --> 00:01:57.966
♪ Face your fears and show you're a hero ♪

25
00:01:58.033 --> 00:02:02.733
♪ The future of the world is in your hand! ♪

26
00:02:02.800 --> 00:02:05.000
♪ Pokémon! ♪

27
00:02:07.966 --> 00:02:10.666
Cloudy Fate, Bright Future!

28
00:02:14.066 --> 00:02:17.433
Our heroes are now at the Anistar City Pokémon Centre,

29
00:02:17.500 --> 00:02:19.633
following Serena's second Princess Key win.

30
00:02:19.700 --> 00:02:23.566
Soon, Ash will battle for his seventh Kalos Gym Badge!

31
00:02:23.633 --> 00:02:25.333
- Cham!
- Braixen!

32
00:02:27.566 --> 00:02:29.733
One more, then it's the Master Class!

33
00:02:29.800 --> 00:02:32.766
- Those Princess Keys are so pretty!
- Mm-hm.

34
00:02:32.833 --> 00:02:34.633
And next, it's you and me!

35
00:02:34.700 --> 00:02:36.033
Eevee!

36
00:02:36.100 --> 00:02:38.000
No way Serena's gonna lose,

37
00:02:38.066 --> 00:02:40.566
and there's no way we're gonna lose either, right?

38
00:02:40.633 --> 00:02:42.033
Pikachu!

39
00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:44.300
- Pika!
- Huh?

40
00:02:44.366 --> 00:02:47.133
It's OK. They're just having fun.

41
00:02:47.200 --> 00:02:49.566
Pika, pika.

42
00:02:49.633 --> 00:02:51.766
Do you remember when Tierno was telling us

43
00:02:51.833 --> 00:02:55.433
about how the Anistar City Gym Leader specialises in Psychic types?

44
00:02:55.500 --> 00:02:57.500
I sure do, and bring it on!

45
00:02:57.566 --> 00:03:00.100
I'm getting my seventh badge, no matter what!

46
00:03:00.166 --> 00:03:01.266
Pi, Pikachu!

47
00:03:01.333 --> 00:03:03.833
All right, race you to the gym!

48
00:03:03.900 --> 00:03:06.533
- Ash, wait up!
- No fair!

49
00:03:06.600 --> 00:03:09.466
Hey, couldn't we just walk for a change?

50
00:03:09.533 --> 00:03:12.733
Our next story concerns Mega Evolution.

51
00:03:12.800 --> 00:03:15.533
Professor Sycamore is scheduled to arrive today

52
00:03:15.600 --> 00:03:19.500
in order to begin research on the sundial, Anistar City's greatest symbol.

53
00:03:19.566 --> 00:03:22.733
Some have theorised that the sundial came from space.

54
00:03:22.800 --> 00:03:25.566
Although its origins remain a mystery,

55
00:03:25.633 --> 00:03:27.866
recent research shows there is a real connection

56
00:03:27.933 --> 00:03:30.733
between the Anistar Sundial and the Mega Stones.

57
00:03:32.100 --> 00:03:35.066
Much attention is being focused on Professor Sycamore,

58
00:03:35.133 --> 00:03:37.666
the leading authority on Mega Evolution,

59
00:03:37.733 --> 00:03:42.000
and what he will discover after researching the sundial.

60
00:03:42.066 --> 00:03:46.900
- So the sundial is today's hot topic.
- It sparkles just like a beautiful jewel!

61
00:03:46.966 --> 00:03:49.933
Some have called it one of Kalos' Seven Wonders!

62
00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:52.500
- It's quite exciting!
- But I wonder...

63
00:03:52.566 --> 00:03:54.900
In what universe is that a sundial?

64
00:03:54.966 --> 00:03:57.166
I'm so glad you asked me that!

65
00:03:58.866 --> 00:04:02.666
It's Professor James' Mysteries of Kalos!

66
00:04:02.733 --> 00:04:07.166
It is said the sundial came to us from space roughly 3,000 years ago,

67
00:04:07.233 --> 00:04:09.533
an object very little is known about.

68
00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:14.533
Ha! We use it to tell time because it always glows at certain intervals!

69
00:04:14.600 --> 00:04:16.733
That sounds just as rare as rare can be.

70
00:04:16.800 --> 00:04:19.366
It sure smells like treasure to me.

71
00:04:19.433 --> 00:04:20.666
Wobba, wobba.

72
00:04:20.733 --> 00:04:23.300
Just think of the huge amount of capital we could amass

73
00:04:23.366 --> 00:04:25.466
by getting our hands on that clock!

74
00:04:25.533 --> 00:04:26.933
Ding!

75
00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:30.600
- To put it simply... swipe the sundial!
- Service with a smile!

76
00:04:30.666 --> 00:04:33.900
Getting our hands on something that massive could be a challenge.

77
00:04:33.966 --> 00:04:35.833
Challenging is who we are!

78
00:04:35.900 --> 00:04:38.266
Wobba, wobba!

79
00:04:49.833 --> 00:04:52.000
Oh, splendid!

80
00:04:52.066 --> 00:04:54.200
With such a mysterious sparkle.

81
00:04:54.266 --> 00:04:57.766
Yeah. It really draws you in, doesn't it?

82
00:05:00.666 --> 00:05:02.633
- All right, you!
- Huh?

83
00:05:02.700 --> 00:05:06.200
What are you doing here? Hurry up and leave here right now!

84
00:05:06.266 --> 00:05:09.166
- You are...
- Sigilyph, out!

85
00:05:11.700 --> 00:05:13.866
- Sigilyph!
- Sigilyph, use Psywave!

86
00:05:13.933 --> 00:05:15.700
Sigil!

87
00:05:17.333 --> 00:05:21.033
- Huh? What's that?
- Pika.

88
00:05:21.100 --> 00:05:23.433
- Let's go find out!
- Right!

89
00:05:23.500 --> 00:05:25.666
Clemont, it's an emergency!

90
00:05:25.733 --> 00:05:28.800
I see that! Not so fast!

91
00:05:28.866 --> 00:05:30.966
What are you doing? That's dangerous!

92
00:05:31.033 --> 00:05:33.233
- This is a warning!
- Warning?

93
00:05:33.300 --> 00:05:35.166
To the one who will show the way!

94
00:05:35.233 --> 00:05:38.500
- Leave this place right now!
- Professor Sycamore!

95
00:05:40.066 --> 00:05:43.000
- Hey, it's Ash.
- Look!

96
00:05:43.066 --> 00:05:45.733
- What happened?
- I can't believe it!

97
00:05:45.800 --> 00:05:50.400
One with a deep-green eye and those who walk alongside it.

98
00:05:50.466 --> 00:05:51.800
I knew it.

99
00:05:51.866 --> 00:05:53.333
Now, Sableye, go!

100
00:05:55.400 --> 00:05:57.666
- Sableye.
- What's going on?

101
00:05:57.733 --> 00:05:59.000
She's battling us!

102
00:05:59.066 --> 00:06:01.200
Hey, what have we done to you, anyway?

103
00:06:02.933 --> 00:06:04.766
Sableye. The Darkness Pokémon.

104
00:06:04.833 --> 00:06:08.166
Living in caves, Sableye digs up gems with its sharp claws,

105
00:06:08.233 --> 00:06:09.600
then devours them.

106
00:06:09.666 --> 00:06:11.466
Now! Power Gem!

107
00:06:11.533 --> 00:06:13.566
Sableye!

108
00:06:13.633 --> 00:06:15.833
-Pika!

109
00:06:15.900 --> 00:06:18.700
Stand back, Professor! Use Electro Ball!

110
00:06:18.766 --> 00:06:21.600
Pika, pika, pika, pi!

111
00:06:22.100 --> 00:06:23.833
Sigil. Lyph.

112
00:06:23.900 --> 00:06:25.400
Frogadier, I choose you!

113
00:06:27.900 --> 00:06:30.366
All right, Frogadier, Water Pulse!

114
00:06:30.433 --> 00:06:32.033
- Frogadier!
- Sableye!

115
00:06:32.100 --> 00:06:35.700
No, Sableye! Sigilyph, Psywave!

116
00:06:35.766 --> 00:06:39.800
- Sigil!
- Pi! Pika!

117
00:06:39.866 --> 00:06:43.433
Can you still battle, Sableye? Then use Shadow Claw!

118
00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:45.933
- Sable!
- Froga!

119
00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:48.100
Oh, man! Are you OK, Frogadier?

120
00:06:48.166 --> 00:06:51.566
- Froga.
- 'Kay, Pikachu, Thunderbolt, let's go!

121
00:06:51.633 --> 00:06:53.833
Pika! Pikachu!

122
00:06:53.900 --> 00:06:56.066
- Aah!
- Sigil!

123
00:06:56.133 --> 00:06:57.433
Aah!

124
00:06:57.500 --> 00:07:00.866
Quick, Sigilyph, return now!

125
00:07:00.933 --> 00:07:03.933
- Ah! Why, you...
- Grrr!

126
00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:07.233
- Now, Power Gem!
- Sableye!

127
00:07:07.300 --> 00:07:10.666
- Water Pulse, go!
- Gadier!

128
00:07:11.966 --> 00:07:14.033
- Now use Aerial Ace!
- Frog!

129
00:07:14.100 --> 00:07:16.166
- Sable!
- Gadier!

130
00:07:16.233 --> 00:07:18.000
Eye!

131
00:07:19.633 --> 00:07:20.866
Sableye...

132
00:07:20.933 --> 00:07:23.433
Ah! Quick, Sableye, return!

133
00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:27.433
How dare you?

134
00:07:27.500 --> 00:07:31.166
For the sake of Anistar and Kalos, leave here immediately!

135
00:07:32.100 --> 00:07:33.700
Aaah!

136
00:07:35.266 --> 00:07:37.133
Aah!

137
00:07:38.833 --> 00:07:40.966
- Pika!
- Ga?

138
00:07:41.033 --> 00:07:42.233
She's floating!

139
00:07:42.300 --> 00:07:45.366
- It's so weird.
- That must be psychic power!

140
00:07:45.433 --> 00:07:46.433
Oh.

141
00:07:46.500 --> 00:07:50.066
- Stand down now, Carrie.
- What? Stand down?

142
00:07:50.133 --> 00:07:52.700
- You heard me!
- Yes, ma'am!

143
00:07:52.766 --> 00:07:55.866
Hey, do you have any idea what you just did, Carrie?

144
00:07:55.933 --> 00:07:56.933
What?

145
00:07:57.000 --> 00:07:58.866
Do you think they're that trainer's friends?

146
00:07:58.933 --> 00:07:59.933
Pika.

147
00:08:02.533 --> 00:08:06.333
The purpose of our appearance is to admonish Carrie for her actions.

148
00:08:06.400 --> 00:08:08.433
- Huh?
- Admonish?

149
00:08:08.500 --> 00:08:11.533
Lady Olympia! I only did it to protect Anistar!

150
00:08:11.600 --> 00:08:14.533
- Silence, Carrie!
- Yes, ma'am!

151
00:08:14.600 --> 00:08:17.300
This has become a bad habit of yours, Carrie!

152
00:08:17.366 --> 00:08:21.400
Acting on what you think Lady Olympia's vision of the future means!

153
00:08:21.466 --> 00:08:24.166
- How many times has this happened?
- Right.

154
00:08:24.233 --> 00:08:25.900
I'm so sorry for everything.

155
00:08:25.966 --> 00:08:29.433
- Excuse us...
- We have no idea what's going on.

156
00:08:29.500 --> 00:08:30.900
- Oh, my!
- Huh?

157
00:08:30.966 --> 00:08:35.000
You're Olympia! Gym Leader of the Anistar Gym!

158
00:08:35.066 --> 00:08:36.633
- Gym Leader?
- Pika?

159
00:08:40.733 --> 00:08:42.666
Indeed I am.

160
00:08:45.066 --> 00:08:47.233
Who's that Pokémon?

161
00:08:52.066 --> 00:08:54.333
It's Sableye!

162
00:08:55.733 --> 00:08:58.000
Sableye!

163
00:08:58.800 --> 00:09:03.300
We ask that you graciously forgive Carrie for her actions.

164
00:09:04.400 --> 00:09:08.133
My name is Charlene. I am Lady Olympia's apprentice.

165
00:09:08.200 --> 00:09:11.400
Professor Sycamore, children.

166
00:09:11.466 --> 00:09:15.633
Please forgive my other apprentice for her rude actions.

167
00:09:15.700 --> 00:09:18.700
Now, Carrie, apologise to them.

168
00:09:18.766 --> 00:09:20.966
I'm so very sorry.

169
00:09:21.033 --> 00:09:24.066
Well, I'm glad we were able to clear that up.

170
00:09:24.133 --> 00:09:26.100
What was this future you referred to?

171
00:09:26.166 --> 00:09:28.200
We saw a vision of it.

172
00:09:28.266 --> 00:09:30.600
I saw disaster approaching soon.

173
00:09:30.666 --> 00:09:34.600
And your fates are all connected to that threat.

174
00:09:34.666 --> 00:09:36.666
Carrie thought you were enemies of Kalos

175
00:09:36.733 --> 00:09:39.000
based on Lady Olympia's premonition.

176
00:09:39.066 --> 00:09:41.600
Enemies?

177
00:09:41.666 --> 00:09:43.600
Frog!

178
00:09:47.500 --> 00:09:50.100
There it is. I see it!

179
00:09:50.166 --> 00:09:51.666
What? What's going on?

180
00:09:51.733 --> 00:09:54.100
What did you just see, Lady Olympia?

181
00:09:54.166 --> 00:09:58.966
- Your future.
- You mean Frogadier?

182
00:09:59.033 --> 00:10:01.166
We'll discuss this at the gym.

183
00:10:01.233 --> 00:10:03.700
- Huh?
- Pika.

184
00:10:10.933 --> 00:10:12.900
- Whoa.
- It's beautiful.

185
00:10:12.966 --> 00:10:14.666
And full of mysticism!

186
00:10:14.733 --> 00:10:18.000
Wow. I'd really like to know how she can see the future like that.

187
00:10:18.066 --> 00:10:21.266
- I want her to see my future as well!
- I do too!

188
00:10:21.333 --> 00:10:23.933
Like if I ever become a Pokémon trainer someday.

189
00:10:24.000 --> 00:10:26.566
- And who will take care of my big brother.
- Gah!

190
00:10:26.633 --> 00:10:28.900
My future is none of your business!

191
00:10:28.966 --> 00:10:31.566
- I'm afraid it's not quite that easy.
- Huh?

192
00:10:31.633 --> 00:10:36.633
It's the voice of the stars that guides Lady Olympia to perceive the future.

193
00:10:36.700 --> 00:10:39.266
That's what happened in the seas off Hoenn.

194
00:10:39.333 --> 00:10:42.033
Yes. Led by the voice of the stars,

195
00:10:42.100 --> 00:10:46.300
Lady Olympia foresaw the clash between Groudon and Kyogre.

196
00:10:52.033 --> 00:10:55.033
The world saw incidents of extreme weather,

197
00:10:55.100 --> 00:10:57.000
but Kalos was prepared.

198
00:10:57.066 --> 00:10:58.733
Thanks to Olympia's vision,

199
00:10:58.800 --> 00:11:02.100
Kalos escaped these incidents largely unharmed.

200
00:11:04.100 --> 00:11:06.133
Could we be connected to something

201
00:11:06.200 --> 00:11:08.533
on as large a scale as the threat you perceived?

202
00:11:08.600 --> 00:11:11.033
That is something we must figure out.

203
00:11:11.100 --> 00:11:14.533
Wow. A Gym Leader who can see the future.

204
00:11:14.600 --> 00:11:15.966
Please tell me, Charlene.

205
00:11:16.033 --> 00:11:18.800
Are these really the ones who will bring danger to Kalos?

206
00:11:18.866 --> 00:11:21.066
Your training has been quite inadequate.

207
00:11:21.133 --> 00:11:23.933
Lady Olympia never said they would bring danger to us.

208
00:11:24.000 --> 00:11:25.033
Oh.

209
00:11:25.100 --> 00:11:29.066
She said they would be trapped within the vortex of this threat.

210
00:11:29.133 --> 00:11:31.533
- Young man.
- Huh?

211
00:11:31.600 --> 00:11:34.033
It appears the vision that I perceived earlier

212
00:11:34.100 --> 00:11:37.033
concerns the future of you and your Frogadier.

213
00:11:37.100 --> 00:11:38.666
Me and Frogadier?

214
00:11:45.733 --> 00:11:47.500
That is correct.

215
00:11:47.566 --> 00:11:50.166
The vision that occurred showed me your Frogadier

216
00:11:50.233 --> 00:11:52.366
is a Pokémon with a curious fate.

217
00:11:52.433 --> 00:11:55.833
That is clear from seeing its past and future.

218
00:11:55.900 --> 00:11:59.000
- Curious fate?
- What does she mean?

219
00:11:59.066 --> 00:12:00.733
Pika.

220
00:12:01.800 --> 00:12:05.200
Frogadier. A Pokémon like no other.

221
00:12:05.266 --> 00:12:09.700
- No other? What's that about?
- Pikachu.

222
00:12:09.766 --> 00:12:12.733
If I may, let me show you what I saw.

223
00:12:19.866 --> 00:12:22.300
- Oh, man.
- Hey. That's a Pokémon Egg!

224
00:12:22.366 --> 00:12:26.800
It is true. To learn about the future, we must first search the past!

225
00:12:26.866 --> 00:12:29.800
This is a Froakie Egg.

226
00:12:29.866 --> 00:12:32.666
Do you know anything about Frogadier's past, Professor?

227
00:12:32.733 --> 00:12:34.800
No, I'm afraid I don't.

228
00:12:34.866 --> 00:12:37.133
I honestly don't know a single thing about it

229
00:12:37.200 --> 00:12:39.800
before it came to me as a Pokémon for new trainers.

230
00:12:43.866 --> 00:12:45.866
Whoa.

231
00:12:48.400 --> 00:12:50.433
Froakie!

232
00:12:53.600 --> 00:12:55.800
Froakie.

233
00:12:55.866 --> 00:12:59.800
This is Froakie, soon after it hatched from its Egg.

234
00:13:06.500 --> 00:13:08.933
- Froa, froa, froa.
- Kie-kie.

235
00:13:09.000 --> 00:13:11.933
- Kie-kie-kie, kie-kie...
- Froa, froa, froa, froa, froa...

236
00:13:12.000 --> 00:13:14.033
- Kie, kie...
- Froa, Froakie!

237
00:13:15.366 --> 00:13:18.366
Froa! Froa! Froa! Froa!

238
00:13:18.433 --> 00:13:21.600
Kie, kie, kie, kie! Froa!

239
00:13:21.666 --> 00:13:23.833
Instead of playing with the others,

240
00:13:23.900 --> 00:13:28.233
this Froakie trained tirelessly, reaching for new heights!

241
00:13:28.300 --> 00:13:29.600
Kie, kie!

242
00:13:29.666 --> 00:13:31.600
Kie?

243
00:13:31.666 --> 00:13:34.600
- Froa, froa!
- Kie, kie. Froa!

244
00:13:34.666 --> 00:13:35.900
- Froa.
- Kie.

245
00:13:35.966 --> 00:13:40.600
However, because your Froakie spent so much time alone,

246
00:13:40.666 --> 00:13:43.633
there was a lot of conflict with others.

247
00:13:46.700 --> 00:13:48.833
Then, one day, someone showed it

248
00:13:48.900 --> 00:13:53.200
that Pokémon can't become strong all by themselves.

249
00:13:53.266 --> 00:13:56.900
Froakie learned that its strength would only be able to reach new heights

250
00:13:56.966 --> 00:13:59.166
by working with a trainer.

251
00:14:00.566 --> 00:14:03.533
But it wasn't just words that made a difference.

252
00:14:03.600 --> 00:14:08.266
What changed Froakie was the kindness this person showed it.

253
00:14:17.100 --> 00:14:21.033
So, instead of being chosen by a trainer,

254
00:14:21.100 --> 00:14:24.733
this Froakie learned how to choose its trainer.

255
00:14:24.800 --> 00:14:27.033
It had one objective.

256
00:14:27.100 --> 00:14:32.766
To see if it was worth devoting its life to that trainer.

257
00:14:32.833 --> 00:14:37.700
From the beginning, Froakie expected a high standard from its trainer.

258
00:14:37.766 --> 00:14:41.433
But somehow, it always felt something lacking.

259
00:14:45.900 --> 00:14:47.566
When you're a new trainer,

260
00:14:47.633 --> 00:14:50.733
not everything goes as smoothly as you would like.

261
00:14:50.800 --> 00:14:54.566
And everyone hesitates when experiencing something new.

262
00:14:55.700 --> 00:14:58.300
However, what this Froakie was yearning for

263
00:14:58.366 --> 00:15:00.366
was something much deeper.

264
00:15:00.433 --> 00:15:04.800
I have a word for that. That word is love!

265
00:15:04.933 --> 00:15:05.966
- Huh?
- Pika...

266
00:15:06.033 --> 00:15:07.866
It's love?

267
00:15:19.933 --> 00:15:24.566
The Pokémon for new trainers that kept returning to the research lab.

268
00:15:24.633 --> 00:15:26.666
That's how Froakie was known back then.

269
00:15:26.733 --> 00:15:29.500
The Pokémon who came back.

270
00:15:29.566 --> 00:15:32.533
- It was love.
- Well, what do you know?

271
00:15:32.600 --> 00:15:35.600
- You chose me!
- Froga, gadier!

272
00:15:35.666 --> 00:15:38.100
I wanna get stronger, just like you do!

273
00:15:38.166 --> 00:15:40.100
So let's get stronger together!

274
00:15:40.166 --> 00:15:41.800
Ga.

275
00:15:41.866 --> 00:15:45.500
My goal is to win the Kalos League and become a Pokémon Master!

276
00:15:45.566 --> 00:15:46.633
Frog!

277
00:15:46.700 --> 00:15:48.033
-Pika!

278
00:15:48.100 --> 00:15:53.033
That's the dream Ash said he'd find someday along with his Pokémon.

279
00:15:53.100 --> 00:15:54.566
Olympia?

280
00:15:54.633 --> 00:15:57.200
Can you tell us what Frogadier's future is?

281
00:15:57.266 --> 00:15:58.266
Hm.

282
00:15:59.833 --> 00:16:03.333
Its power will become greater and greater.

283
00:16:03.400 --> 00:16:06.333
Does that mean Frogadier will become Greninja?

284
00:16:06.400 --> 00:16:09.200
Hm. That I don't know.

285
00:16:09.266 --> 00:16:11.333
However, I do know this.

286
00:16:11.400 --> 00:16:15.833
It will reach new heights that no one has ever seen before!

287
00:16:15.900 --> 00:16:19.833
And the two of you will reach those new heights together.

288
00:16:19.900 --> 00:16:21.833
Could you mean Mega Evolution?

289
00:16:21.900 --> 00:16:23.266
-Mega Evolution?

290
00:16:23.333 --> 00:16:26.500
Though no one has yet seen a Greninja that could Mega Evolve.

291
00:16:26.566 --> 00:16:29.566
- Pika!
- That's incredible!

292
00:16:29.633 --> 00:16:32.933
A new power that no one has ever seen before's a really big deal!

293
00:16:33.000 --> 00:16:35.166
Not just a big deal, it's a huge deal!

294
00:16:35.233 --> 00:16:37.166
I can't wait for that to happen!

295
00:16:38.700 --> 00:16:42.200
Then let's go. The future's out there, just waiting for us!

296
00:16:43.533 --> 00:16:45.200
Frog.

297
00:16:45.266 --> 00:16:48.033
But first, I need to win my seventh badge!

298
00:16:48.100 --> 00:16:49.200
Gadier!

299
00:16:49.266 --> 00:16:52.833
So, Olympia, I'd like to have a Gym Battle with you right now!

300
00:16:52.900 --> 00:16:55.833
That's right. Who are you?

301
00:16:55.900 --> 00:17:00.533
- Ash Ketchum from Pallet Town!
- I accept your challenge!

302
00:17:04.333 --> 00:17:08.366
- Ah! What's wrong?
- The sundial is in grave danger.

303
00:17:08.433 --> 00:17:10.800
- The sundial?
- Pika?

304
00:17:10.866 --> 00:17:13.000
Use Helping Hand!

305
00:17:13.066 --> 00:17:15.000
Meowstic! Meow!

306
00:17:18.433 --> 00:17:20.266
Meow!

307
00:17:20.333 --> 00:17:21.599
-Pika!

308
00:17:21.666 --> 00:17:24.099
Meow!

309
00:17:24.933 --> 00:17:28.366
That's it! Future Sight!

310
00:17:28.433 --> 00:17:30.733
Meow!

311
00:17:33.166 --> 00:17:34.400
What was that?

312
00:17:34.466 --> 00:17:36.066
Future Sight is a move that takes time

313
00:17:36.133 --> 00:17:39.500
from when the Pokémon uses it until the attack takes effect.

314
00:17:39.566 --> 00:17:42.100
What does she mean, the sundial's in danger?

315
00:17:42.166 --> 00:17:44.333
I saw the vision too!

316
00:17:44.400 --> 00:17:47.833
Greedy evildoers are going after the sundial!

317
00:17:47.900 --> 00:17:50.400
Of course! Olympia used Future Sight

318
00:17:50.466 --> 00:17:52.566
because she saw it happening in the future!

319
00:17:52.633 --> 00:17:55.066
- Come on, let's move!
- Right!

320
00:17:57.900 --> 00:17:59.300
Lady Olympia!

321
00:18:00.233 --> 00:18:02.900
The evil ones who are after the sundial

322
00:18:02.966 --> 00:18:07.866
will also play a key role in the ring of fate that threatens Kalos!

323
00:18:09.433 --> 00:18:11.600
Pi, pi, pi, pi!

324
00:18:11.666 --> 00:18:14.366
Pika!

325
00:18:14.433 --> 00:18:18.500
- Begin Operation Sundial Swipe!
- It's just our type!

326
00:18:18.566 --> 00:18:20.366
Wobba, wobba!

327
00:18:20.433 --> 00:18:23.600
- Unh! Team Rocket!
- No way! They wanna steal that?

328
00:18:23.666 --> 00:18:26.366
That means Olympia saw Team Rocket in her vision!

329
00:18:27.166 --> 00:18:28.166
- Aah!
- Pika.

330
00:18:33.466 --> 00:18:36.400
Come on, come on, come on, come on!

331
00:18:36.466 --> 00:18:39.166
Puh-lease! It's not moving!

332
00:18:39.233 --> 00:18:41.400
Gah! Give it the gas!

333
00:18:46.700 --> 00:18:49.766
- Team Rocket, stop it now!
- Pika, pika!

334
00:18:49.833 --> 00:18:50.833
Oh, give it a rest!

335
00:18:50.900 --> 00:18:54.066
Say, maybe we should tell you dopes to go jump in a lake!

336
00:18:54.133 --> 00:18:56.400
That's not a bad idea. They just might!

337
00:18:56.466 --> 00:18:59.000
Wobb, Wobbuffet!

338
00:18:59.066 --> 00:19:01.700
Frogadier, use Water Pulse!

339
00:19:01.766 --> 00:19:03.600
Froga, gadier!

340
00:19:07.600 --> 00:19:10.033
It's being damaged!

341
00:19:15.700 --> 00:19:17.733
-Pika?

342
00:19:22.766 --> 00:19:25.233
- Hey, is that what I think it is?
- That's right.

343
00:19:25.300 --> 00:19:27.833
- Huh?
- That Future Sight from before just hit!

344
00:19:29.666 --> 00:19:32.633
We haven't stolen anything yet!

345
00:19:32.700 --> 00:19:35.333
This doesn't help our reputation one whit!

346
00:19:35.400 --> 00:19:38.166
First chance I get, I'm gonna file a complaint!

347
00:19:38.233 --> 00:19:42.033
As soon as I learn how to swim, I'm coming back!

348
00:19:42.100 --> 00:19:44.600
Wobba, wobba!

349
00:19:44.666 --> 00:19:47.966
But we're blasting off for now!

350
00:19:50.900 --> 00:19:54.433
Olympia's Future Sight is truly terrifyingly accurate.

351
00:19:54.500 --> 00:19:55.833
Never saw that before...

352
00:19:55.900 --> 00:20:00.833
It's not something a person could use unless you're able to see the future.

353
00:20:00.900 --> 00:20:04.433
Meow, meow.

354
00:20:07.000 --> 00:20:09.300
You're really going to battle her, Ash?

355
00:20:09.366 --> 00:20:11.533
She'll be an awesome opponent!

356
00:20:11.600 --> 00:20:14.266
It won't be long till I have my seventh Gym Badge!

357
00:20:14.333 --> 00:20:16.300
- Pika!
- Dier!

358
00:20:17.433 --> 00:20:20.100
Be cautious when you challenge me.

359
00:20:20.166 --> 00:20:22.900
You're bound to sense new possibilities.

360
00:20:22.966 --> 00:20:28.166
Unlimited possibilities between people and Pokémon!

361
00:20:28.233 --> 00:20:32.166
And so, Ash's next battle will be against Gym Leader Olympia,

362
00:20:32.233 --> 00:20:34.933
who specialises in Psychic-type Pokémon

363
00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:37.433
and can also see into the future!

364
00:20:37.500 --> 00:20:39.933
Though Frogadier's future is as yet unclear,

365
00:20:40.000 --> 00:20:44.000
Ash's Anistar City Gym Battle challenge is a certainty,

366
00:20:44.066 --> 00:20:47.100
as the journey continues!
